(3477519, 485601, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thought it was too busy, until I began to actually look at the walls.  Got some neat paraphernalia captured in the image.  Still, it does overwhelm your main subject, if it is the person playing the guitar.</td>', 'Thought it was too busy, until I began to actually look at the walls.  Got some neat paraphernalia captured in the image.  Still, it does overwhelm your main subject, if it is the person playing the guitar.', '2007-03-21 06:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477523, 486500, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seems way overprocessed.  Softer light might have been better.  Either less exposure or les saturation.</td>', 'Seems way overprocessed.  Softer light might have been better.  Either less exposure or les saturation.', '2007-03-21 06:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477529, 484351, 35602, '<td valign="top">Need better focus, and it looks like only one lightsource, the sun.</td>', 'Need better focus, and it looks like only one lightsource, the sun.', '2007-03-21 06:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477532, 486315, 35602, '<td valign="top">Interesting technique.  The only thing is that your squares of light are very soft.  I have a feeling it is because you might have had to use too short a shutter speed, or maybe your subject moved as you were shooting the image.  Good clarity in shadows need a longer shutter, and a very still subject.</td>', 'Interesting technique.  The only thing is that your squares of light are very soft.  I have a feeling it is because you might have had to use too short a shutter speed, or maybe your subject moved as you were shooting the image.  Good clarity in shadows need a longer shutter, and a very still subject.', '2007-03-21 06:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477536, 486476, 35602, '<td valign="top">LIghting is very flat and background is too bright.  One way to get a neutral gray background to highlight the subject without overwhelming it is to shine a light on the background from right or left, and place a handkerchief or other diffuser over the light so it will soften the light.</td>', 'LIghting is very flat and background is too bright.  One way to get a neutral gray background to highlight the subject without overwhelming it is to shine a light on the background from right or left, and place a handkerchief or other diffuser over the light so it will soften the light.', '2007-03-21 06:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477559, 484167, 35602, '<td valign="top">Pretty</td>', 'Pretty', '2007-03-21 06:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477562, 484227, 42181, '<td valign="top">This would have looked great with Canon gear ;-) 7</td>', 'This would have looked great with Canon gear ;-) 7', '2007-03-21 06:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477569, 486640, 35602, '<td valign="top">Overall the image seems very out of balance with lighting as well as badly toned.  did  you use tungsten setting, or flash?  White balance is definitely off and there is some distracting flares in the image.</td>', 'Overall the image seems very out of balance with lighting as well as badly toned.  did  you use tungsten setting, or flash?  White balance is definitely off and there is some distracting flares in the image.', '2007-03-21 07:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477573, 486619, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not all that interesting and details seems really lost.  Not sure what I am looking at.</td>', 'Not all that interesting and details seems really lost.  Not sure what I am looking at.', '2007-03-21 07:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477574, 485758, 35602, '<td valign="top">Found the shawl to be distracting near the top, and focus is way off.  Lighting for texture would have been better.  Light to the right, higher than camera height and reflector (tinfoil can be used) needs to be played with to cast just the right amount of light to catch the texture of the fabric.</td>', 'Found the shawl to be distracting near the top, and focus is way off.  Lighting for texture would have been better.  Light to the right, higher than camera height and reflector (tinfoil can be used) needs to be played with to cast just the right amount of light to catch the texture of the fabric.', '2007-03-21 07:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477576, 485606, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very sweet portrait.  Got just the right amount of texture and detail on fur, which looks soft but still has a lot of definition.  Great use of lighting.</td>', 'Very sweet portrait.  Got just the right amount of texture and detail on fur, which looks soft but still has a lot of definition.  Great use of lighting.', '2007-03-21 07:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477591, 486567, 42181, '<td valign="top">Superb, both the image and the use of multiple lights, looks like a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Superb, both the image and the use of multiple lights, looks like a ribbon winner.', '2007-03-21 07:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477596, 486222, 42181, '<td valign="top">Good picture of the face with the dappled light but strange effect with the additional light on the ear, obviously you needed it for the multiple light source, IMO it just looks a little odd.</td>', 'Good picture of the face with the dappled light but strange effect with the additional light on the ear, obviously you needed it for the multiple light source, IMO it just looks a little odd.', '2007-03-21 07:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3477599, 486627, 42181, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the flowers with their individual lights, shame about the harsh shadows.</td>', 'Nice shot of the flowers with their individual lights, shame about the harsh shadows.', '2007-03-21 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
