(3478511, 485787, 67671, '<td valign="top">I find the strong light on the back of the bench, and the top of the dolls head, are distracting, also the reflections in the dolls face, from the flash, I do like the shot otherwise, maybe a step to your left would take the back of the bench out of shot, and a reflector, instead of a flash, would reduce the reflection in the dolls face, a polerising filter may help with the reflections as well. good luck, I hope you find this helpfull.6</td>', 'I find the strong light on the back of the bench, and the top of the dolls head, are distracting, also the reflections in the dolls face, from the flash, I do like the shot otherwise, maybe a step to your left would take the back of the bench out of shot, and a reflector, instead of a flash, would reduce the reflection in the dolls face, a polerising filter may help with the reflections as well. good luck, I hope you find this helpfull.6', '2007-03-21 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
