(3478655, 486628, 3037, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see photos from Oregon in the challenge. I like this image. It is well-light with multiple lights and the trees in bloom are a nice addition. It seems the photo is either a little too stark or a little overcontrasted, probably due to the brightness of the capital against the darkness of the sky. It''s good to see home again.</td>', 'It''s nice to see photos from Oregon in the challenge. I like this image. It is well-light with multiple lights and the trees in bloom are a nice addition. It seems the photo is either a little too stark or a little overcontrasted, probably due to the brightness of the capital against the darkness of the sky. It''s good to see home again.', '2007-03-21 13:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
