(3481802, 486291, 67237, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot .. let me guess how you made it with basic editing rules.  If its a night shot: ...long shot, maybe 4 seconds in very low light (that is one light) coming from rear left, you sittng there for 2 seconds..someone else turns light off...you leave..flash shoots fron rear left (thats the second light) ..end of exposure.... If its a natural light shot..same thing but instead of turning light off just covering the lens....Not the best picture on the worls but it made me think so I will give you an 8.</td>', 'Interesting shot .. let me guess how you made it with basic editing rules.  If its a night shot: ...long shot, maybe 4 seconds in very low light (that is one light) coming from rear left, you sittng there for 2 seconds..someone else turns light off...you leave..flash shoots fron rear left (thats the second light) ..end of exposure.... If its a natural light shot..same thing but instead of turning light off just covering the lens....Not the best picture on the worls but it made me think so I will give you an 8.', '2007-03-22 16:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
