(3482398, 486306, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the way the vertical reflections of golden light mirror the superstructure of the bridge.</td>', 'Love the way the vertical reflections of golden light mirror the superstructure of the bridge.', '2007-03-22 22:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482400, 485770, 58452, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.  Funny!  Especially the expression on the kids face.  I don''t think that info is gonna take.  Failed CRC check.  See the eyes?   LOL  I''d have put the cable on the kid in his ear or perhaps connected to his head some way.  I can''t see evidence of multiple light sources, but don''t worry I don''t vote DNMC.  I look at the merits of the image and this one merits a good score for creativity, composition, and tones.  Nice! Bumping this one to an 8.</td>', 'Creative idea.  Funny!  Especially the expression on the kids face.  I don''t think that info is gonna take.  Failed CRC check.  See the eyes?   LOL  I''d have put the cable on the kid in his ear or perhaps connected to his head some way.  I can''t see evidence of multiple light sources, but don''t worry I don''t vote DNMC.  I look at the merits of the image and this one merits a good score for creativity, composition, and tones.  Nice! Bumping this one to an 8.', '2007-03-22 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482402, 486285, 58452, '<td valign="top">Flashing into bright light upon entering the atmosphere.  Nice composition and form.  Bumping this one to 8.</td>', 'Flashing into bright light upon entering the atmosphere.  Nice composition and form.  Bumping this one to 8.', '2007-03-22 22:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482406, 486577, 58452, '<td valign="top">Stat u Art????  If it is you''ve mastered the beautiful colors.  I almost don''t realize this is a woodie composition.  I love the use of colors here.  Nice composition too.  It''s got to be Art.  The cherry is always just out of reach.  (Could be Slippy looking for that 5th red)</td>', 'Stat u Art????  If it is you''ve mastered the beautiful colors.  I almost don''t realize this is a woodie composition.  I love the use of colors here.  Nice composition too.  It''s got to be Art.  The cherry is always just out of reach.  (Could be Slippy looking for that 5th red)', '2007-03-22 22:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482411, 486479, 58452, '<td valign="top">I''ve got a  new flash light like that........</td>', 'I''ve got a  new flash light like that........', '2007-03-22 22:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482458, 486631, 42495, '<td valign="top">Cool effect with the green "smoke".</td>', 'Cool effect with the green "smoke".', '2007-03-22 22:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482473, 486438, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great colors; love the title.</td>', 'Great colors; love the title.', '2007-03-22 22:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482475, 485770, 42495, '<td valign="top">On one level this is disturbing, yet on another I really like it...</td>', 'On one level this is disturbing, yet on another I really like it...', '2007-03-22 22:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482538, 486638, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygosh!   What a beautiful little girl, and a precious portrait!   Who cares about a dumb score (although I hope this is getting a great one) when you end up with a photo like this to enjoy forever!  :)</td>', 'Ohmygosh!   What a beautiful little girl, and a precious portrait!   Who cares about a dumb score (although I hope this is getting a great one) when you end up with a photo like this to enjoy forever!  :)', '2007-03-22 23:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482540, 484223, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww. . .that is PRECIOUS!   What a sweet moment you have captured!</td>', 'Awwwwww. . .that is PRECIOUS!   What a sweet moment you have captured!', '2007-03-22 23:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482543, 486438, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  For some reason, this is exactly the "look" I think of when I think of multiple light sources.  This is my favorite so far!</td>', 'This is awesome!  For some reason, this is exactly the "look" I think of when I think of multiple light sources.  This is my favorite so far!', '2007-03-22 23:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482544, 486616, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty!  I love the matte looking light on the "eggs".  It is really beautiful.</td>', 'How pretty!  I love the matte looking light on the "eggs".  It is really beautiful.', '2007-03-22 23:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482546, 486439, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great capture; perfect illumination on their faces.</td>', 'Great capture; perfect illumination on their faces.', '2007-03-22 23:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482549, 484750, 24454, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  I''ve seen several photos of that amazing structure, but the good ones never cease to bring involuntary gasps immediately upon opening -- This is certainly one of those -- and my first 10!   Beautiful work!</td>', 'Whoa!  I''ve seen several photos of that amazing structure, but the good ones never cease to bring involuntary gasps immediately upon opening -- This is certainly one of those -- and my first 10!   Beautiful work!', '2007-03-22 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482555, 486629, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooooh, I like this one!   It has a very haunting quality, but in a good way!   I love your composition!</td>', 'Ooooooh, I like this one!   It has a very haunting quality, but in a good way!   I love your composition!', '2007-03-22 23:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482558, 486603, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!   This multi-colored light photo is what comes to my mind when I think of multiple light sources.   Great job.</td>', 'This is awesome!   This multi-colored light photo is what comes to my mind when I think of multiple light sources.   Great job.', '2007-03-22 23:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
