(3482625, 485053, 75192, '<td valign="top">Love it... very pretty. I would definitely like this is a print if it''s available.</td>', 'Love it... very pretty. I would definitely like this is a print if it''s available.', '2007-03-22 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482626, 485641, 42495, '<td valign="top">It looks like you caught perfect time of day for this.  Composition &amp; reflection really add to spacing of the lights.</td>', 'It looks like you caught perfect time of day for this.  Composition & reflection really add to spacing of the lights.', '2007-03-22 23:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482628, 484223, 75192, '<td valign="top">Very cute!</td>', 'Very cute!', '2007-03-22 23:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482634, 486533, 62187, '<td valign="top">I thought it was supposed to be lighting sources, not writing sources? Ha ha...just kidding. I love it. What a beautiful photo - so crisp and clean, perfect framing. In my framing, this is what the challenge was asking for - not just a bunch of lights. Your photo passes with flying colors (or lack of!) and is in a class almost by itself. Not a very interesting subject by itself, but your photo captures the subject flawlessly....nothing less then 10.</td>', 'I thought it was supposed to be lighting sources, not writing sources? Ha ha...just kidding. I love it. What a beautiful photo - so crisp and clean, perfect framing. In my framing, this is what the challenge was asking for - not just a bunch of lights. Your photo passes with flying colors (or lack of!) and is in a class almost by itself. Not a very interesting subject by itself, but your photo captures the subject flawlessly....nothing less then 10.', '2007-03-22 23:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3482636, 485811, 75192, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2007-03-22 23:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
