(3485455, 486401, 64610, '<td valign="top">I love the emotion this picture creates.  Very sweet.</td>', 'I love the emotion this picture creates.  Very sweet.', '2007-03-24 15:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485457, 486258, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the focus and composition, but there are some distracting spots (reflections?) in the open space just below the vase.</td>', 'I like the focus and composition, but there are some distracting spots (reflections?) in the open space just below the vase.', '2007-03-24 15:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485466, 486406, 61651, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite know how you got this shot, but I like the abstract quality of it.</td>', 'I don''t quite know how you got this shot, but I like the abstract quality of it.', '2007-03-24 15:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485470, 486629, 61651, '<td valign="top">The composition and play of light could lend this image a nice mood, but I think what appears to be too much sharpening is very distracting.</td>', 'The composition and play of light could lend this image a nice mood, but I think what appears to be too much sharpening is very distracting.', '2007-03-24 15:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485590, 485435, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the colours and lighting here, however, I hate the border. It ruins a lot on the value of the photo (it has an RGB computer feeling which does not match the atmosphere of a crystal ball and future predictions). I would have added no border to this one at all, or I would have added a 1 pixel wide black and 15 pixel wide white around.</td>', 'I love the colours and lighting here, however, I hate the border. It ruins a lot on the value of the photo (it has an RGB computer feeling which does not match the atmosphere of a crystal ball and future predictions). I would have added no border to this one at all, or I would have added a 1 pixel wide black and 15 pixel wide white around.', '2007-03-24 17:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485811, 486456, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very nice, almost surreal.<br/>8</td>', 'Very nice, almost surreal.8', '2007-03-24 19:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485817, 486443, 65234, '<td valign="top">The negative space and seriousness of his expression make me think he is contemplating something not fully known, but sad ... or at least not something he''s looking forward to.  It feels like you could crop some of that out without losing the mood, but maybe not.</td>', 'The negative space and seriousness of his expression make me think he is contemplating something not fully known, but sad ... or at least not something he''s looking forward to.  It feels like you could crop some of that out without losing the mood, but maybe not.', '2007-03-24 19:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485823, 486578, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not getting this one; sorry.</td>', 'Not getting this one; sorry.', '2007-03-24 19:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485826, 485053, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty in an abstract sort of way.  The colored shadows are nice.</td>', 'Pretty in an abstract sort of way.  The colored shadows are nice.', '2007-03-24 19:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485836, 484680, 65234, '<td valign="top">Teddy Grahams and frosting, huh?  Cute.</td>', 'Teddy Grahams and frosting, huh?  Cute.', '2007-03-24 19:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485839, 486332, 65234, '<td valign="top">That looks rather dangerous.</td>', 'That looks rather dangerous.', '2007-03-24 19:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485851, 486629, 65234, '<td valign="top">The pattern of light is fun, even though I would ordinarily prefer a solid background for a patterned cat.  All the warm tones make it work together pretty nicely, and the eyes stand out beautifully.  Looks like some parts of the image are somewhat oversharp and some over-smooth, but that could be me.</td>', 'The pattern of light is fun, even though I would ordinarily prefer a solid background for a patterned cat.  All the warm tones make it work together pretty nicely, and the eyes stand out beautifully.  Looks like some parts of the image are somewhat oversharp and some over-smooth, but that could be me.', '2007-03-24 19:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485855, 486493, 65234, '<td valign="top">They don''t look terribly appealing at this stage.  Interesting.</td>', 'They don''t look terribly appealing at this stage.  Interesting.', '2007-03-24 19:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485856, 486567, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Sharp and picks up the lights'' colors nicely.</td>', 'Well done!  Sharp and picks up the lights'' colors nicely.', '2007-03-24 19:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485858, 486096, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice reflected light.</td>', 'Nice reflected light.', '2007-03-24 19:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
