(3486210, 486120, 15511, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, Grillin'' season...<br/>I believe the upper vent is supposed to be down-wind... ;&gt;)</td>', 'Ahhh, Grillin'' season...I believe the upper vent is supposed to be down-wind... ;>)', '2007-03-24 23:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486214, 486456, 15511, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image.', '2007-03-24 23:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486313, 486567, 53316, '<td valign="top">See this type of thing all the time in Advanced - I hope you get the credit you deserve since this is basic, and not do-able in post.</td>', 'See this type of thing all the time in Advanced - I hope you get the credit you deserve since this is basic, and not do-able in post.', '2007-03-25 02:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486323, 485913, 53316, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=412794" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a>, about one of my entries.  You might be getting voted down for pre-existing artwork, since I''m assuming that''s what this is. However! I find this shot absolutely stunning. It really did make a big impact when it loaded! I said wow :-)  So what I''m getting at with the thread is, if this is pre-existing artwork, and if you are getting voted down for it, don''t let it make you too unhappy.  I''m a little unclear to where the multiple light sources are, but I think I see.</td>', 'Reminds me of this, about one of my entries.  You might be getting voted down for pre-existing artwork, since I''m assuming that''s what this is. However! I find this shot absolutely stunning. It really did make a big impact when it loaded! I said wow :-)  So what I''m getting at with the thread is, if this is pre-existing artwork, and if you are getting voted down for it, don''t let it make you too unhappy.  I''m a little unclear to where the multiple light sources are, but I think I see.', '2007-03-25 02:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486324, 486211, 53316, '<td valign="top">Looks like the skull of a bird of prey. Very neat.</td>', 'Looks like the skull of a bird of prey. Very neat.', '2007-03-25 02:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486325, 486529, 53316, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sense of motion.</td>', 'Gorgeous sense of motion.', '2007-03-25 02:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486327, 485770, 53316, '<td valign="top">WOAH! Freaky concept, and well done.</td>', 'WOAH! Freaky concept, and well done.', '2007-03-25 02:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486329, 486540, 53316, '<td valign="top">You get extra points from me for being one of the only shots I''ve seen of "a reflection where the reflection is not faded at all" that I like.</td>', 'You get extra points from me for being one of the only shots I''ve seen of "a reflection where the reflection is not faded at all" that I like.', '2007-03-25 02:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486331, 486621, 53316, '<td valign="top">Pine cone?  Neat abstract although I wish there had been more detail in the shadows.</td>', 'Pine cone?  Neat abstract although I wish there had been more detail in the shadows.', '2007-03-25 02:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486333, 486401, 53316, '<td valign="top">I''m maybe missing the multiple light sources. I''m blaming this on myself since I do not know anything about studio lighting. This is SO SOOOO cute!! I like that the background is not a solid black color, but almost, and love the pose of the puppies.</td>', 'I''m maybe missing the multiple light sources. I''m blaming this on myself since I do not know anything about studio lighting. This is SO SOOOO cute!! I like that the background is not a solid black color, but almost, and love the pose of the puppies.', '2007-03-25 02:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486335, 486454, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aahhhhhhhhhhhh beautiful.  (If you look at some of the earlier stuff posted to my portfolio you''ll see I''m a fan of these types of shots.)</td>', 'Aahhhhhhhhhhhh beautiful.  (If you look at some of the earlier stuff posted to my portfolio you''ll see I''m a fan of these types of shots.)', '2007-03-25 02:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486336, 486306, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great colors. They work very well together.</td>', 'Great colors. They work very well together.', '2007-03-25 02:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486345, 486457, 53316, '<td valign="top">Huh. Trying to figure out if the reflection is a "source". But I''ll give it to you, since I''d count the moon as a source of light.  Very gorgeous colors.</td>', 'Huh. Trying to figure out if the reflection is a "source". But I''ll give it to you, since I''d count the moon as a source of light.  Very gorgeous colors.', '2007-03-25 02:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486348, 485880, 53316, '<td valign="top">I was about to say I had no idea what this was. But isn''t it the pyramid? Interesting shot, although I''m afraid if people don''t know there''s one of those in Vegas then you''ll be voted lower.</td>', 'I was about to say I had no idea what this was. But isn''t it the pyramid? Interesting shot, although I''m afraid if people don''t know there''s one of those in Vegas then you''ll be voted lower.', '2007-03-25 02:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486447, 486529, 76017, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2007-03-25 04:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486492, 486457, 66341, '<td valign="top">I like this. Personally I would''ve raised the black point post processing to increase the boldness of the silhouette.</td>', 'I like this. Personally I would''ve raised the black point post processing to increase the boldness of the silhouette.', '2007-03-25 05:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486525, 485646, 66341, '<td valign="top">A great photo, but only one light source is obvious to me.</td>', 'A great photo, but only one light source is obvious to me.', '2007-03-25 06:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486527, 486507, 66341, '<td valign="top">If you have this in RAW format, try putting it in Photomatix - the sky will really come alive.</td>', 'If you have this in RAW format, try putting it in Photomatix - the sky will really come alive.', '2007-03-25 06:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486528, 484598, 66341, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but only one light source is obvious to me</td>', 'Nice photo, but only one light source is obvious to me', '2007-03-25 06:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
