(3491449, 486349, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo overall.  In this case, the lighting is so well distributed it''s hard to tell if there''s more than one light or not.  Hmmm...  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a nice photo overall.  In this case, the lighting is so well distributed it''s hard to tell if there''s more than one light or not.  Hmmm...  Good luck.', '2007-03-27 17:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3491451, 486020, 30049, '<td valign="top">This image does a nice job of meeting the challenge of multiple light sources.  Quite evident, which helps.  As for the image itself, it''s "ok".  For me personally the subject matter lacks interest.  JMO of course.  I do wish you luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This image does a nice job of meeting the challenge of multiple light sources.  Quite evident, which helps.  As for the image itself, it''s "ok".  For me personally the subject matter lacks interest.  JMO of course.  I do wish you luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-27 17:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3491455, 486315, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun abstract type image that makes the viewer stop for a moment to take it in.  Seems to me however, that there''s only one main light source for this?  Still a cool photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a fun abstract type image that makes the viewer stop for a moment to take it in.  Seems to me however, that there''s only one main light source for this?  Still a cool photo.  Good luck.', '2007-03-27 17:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3491458, 484598, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice composition on this still life type photo.  You''re a bit overexposed on the top of the lamp, but I imagine you''ve heard that a few times by now.  :D  As for multiple light sources, I don''t get it - there''s only one lamp?  Yes, I know the light goes in various directions, but it comes from one source.  Oh well...  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition on this still life type photo.  You''re a bit overexposed on the top of the lamp, but I imagine you''ve heard that a few times by now.  :D  As for multiple light sources, I don''t get it - there''s only one lamp?  Yes, I know the light goes in various directions, but it comes from one source.  Oh well...  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-03-27 17:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3491463, 484216, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is kind of cool to look at.  AND you have multiple light sources - HOORAY!  :D  Sorry, been looking at too many that only used one.  You did a nice job of controlling the light you worked with here.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is kind of cool to look at.  AND you have multiple light sources - HOORAY!  :D  Sorry, been looking at too many that only used one.  You did a nice job of controlling the light you worked with here.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-27 17:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3491468, 486438, 30049, '<td valign="top">What a nice location for a challenge like this - eh?  :)  Nice use of subject material and composition for this.  Well focused and exposed as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What a nice location for a challenge like this - eh?  :)  Nice use of subject material and composition for this.  Well focused and exposed as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-27 17:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3491537, 486223, 76162, '<td valign="top">A very nice use of fill-in flash in good balance with the sunlight, composition is not bad but content is not much (I guess he is seeing something we don''t)</td>', 'A very nice use of fill-in flash in good balance with the sunlight, composition is not bad but content is not much (I guess he is seeing something we don''t)', '2007-03-27 18:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
