(3491589, 486632, 12611, '<td valign="top">Fantastic; very nice and impressionist; perhaps the problem is color here, if there is any problem. You have the red but its not really a warm firey glow- and then that stark purple. TO me, that really distracts from the beautiful reflection and makes this a technical rather than art driven shot. Good luck though.</td>', 'Fantastic; very nice and impressionist; perhaps the problem is color here, if there is any problem. You have the red but its not really a warm firey glow- and then that stark purple. TO me, that really distracts from the beautiful reflection and makes this a technical rather than art driven shot. Good luck though.', '2007-03-27 18:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
