(3492656, 486540, 10702, '<td valign="top">PEOPLE<br/> <br/>You are letting me so down. This result is making me lose all faith in DPC voters, do you have no taste at ALL !<br/> <br/>For all the images that ended up behind me, sorry, you all should have outscored this one.<br/> <br/>I really don''t get it, Im superhappy to get a score like this, dont get me wrong, but really, is it enough to have few lights and a lot of colour to impress people so much.<br/> <br/>Well, it will take me few more years I think to totally understand this, but in the meantime, thanks alot everyone, I am now really determined to outscore this image to get off my profile start up page :)</td>', 'PEOPLE You are letting me so down. This result is making me lose all faith in DPC voters, do you have no taste at ALL ! For all the images that ended up behind me, sorry, you all should have outscored this one. I really don''t get it, Im superhappy to get a score like this, dont get me wrong, but really, is it enough to have few lights and a lot of colour to impress people so much. Well, it will take me few more years I think to totally understand this, but in the meantime, thanks alot everyone, I am now really determined to outscore this image to get off my profile start up page :)', '2007-03-28 01:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
