(3493407, 486399, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty!  It''s simple. . .even more appealing because of its simpliciy!  And I love the way it is processed in black and white.<br/> <br/></td>', 'How pretty!  It''s simple. . .even more appealing because of its simpliciy!  And I love the way it is processed in black and white. ', '2007-03-28 08:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493408, 484368, 72641, '<td valign="top">@TJinGuy and @Blue Moon:<br/>It looks like one light source, but the light itself burns. Maybe it looks like it''s not because of the ''unclear'' glass.<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for voting and the comments.</td>', '@TJinGuy and @Blue Moon:It looks like one light source, but the light itself burns. Maybe it looks like it''s not because of the ''unclear'' glass. Thanks everyone for voting and the comments.', '2007-03-28 08:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493442, 486540, 8610, '<td valign="top">DPC voters got no honor and taste by voting this pic so high, this is obliviously one of the worst pictures that i have seen from Oskar</td>', 'DPC voters got no honor and taste by voting this pic so high, this is obliviously one of the worst pictures that i have seen from Oskar', '2007-03-28 08:53:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493460, 485153, 23484, '<td valign="top">Actually, I think you captured the idea very well. The focus seems a little soft but not too bad. Nice shot.</td>', 'Actually, I think you captured the idea very well. The focus seems a little soft but not too bad. Nice shot.', '2007-03-28 09:07:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493462, 486629, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo! Love the colors and understated, yet very captivating eyes. Excellent entry!</td>', 'Very cool photo! Love the colors and understated, yet very captivating eyes. Excellent entry!', '2007-03-28 09:07:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493465, 486614, 23484, '<td valign="top">That is cool idea Don. Another one of those team suck shots that actually make you think.</td>', 'That is cool idea Don. Another one of those team suck shots that actually make you think.', '2007-03-28 09:09:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493469, 486505, 66597, '<td valign="top">Bob, excellent job with the lighting here. Your exposure looks spot-on. Maybe I''m going crazy, but the horizon looks skewed slightly to the right?  It''s the slight tilt on the top tower that is either creating an optical illusion or is indicative of need of minute adjustment. At any rate, not a big deal - your architectural shots are very strong indeed!</td>', 'Bob, excellent job with the lighting here. Your exposure looks spot-on. Maybe I''m going crazy, but the horizon looks skewed slightly to the right?  It''s the slight tilt on the top tower that is either creating an optical illusion or is indicative of need of minute adjustment. At any rate, not a big deal - your architectural shots are very strong indeed!', '2007-03-28 09:12:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493470, 486629, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I love the darkness and the color. I think what''s interesting is the low contrast that makes the cat almost blend into the background.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I love the darkness and the color. I think what''s interesting is the low contrast that makes the cat almost blend into the background.', '2007-03-28 09:12:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493476, 485153, 66597, '<td valign="top">Julianne, this is an interesting idea and I think you did a good job of capturing it. The fear on your model''s face (this is you, I believe?) is palpable. Any photo that appeals viscerally to emotion is successful in my book and this definitely pulls it off. In fact, the face is so captivating I didn''t even notice the breast until I saw Kelly''s comment below.</td>', 'Julianne, this is an interesting idea and I think you did a good job of capturing it. The fear on your model''s face (this is you, I believe?) is palpable. Any photo that appeals viscerally to emotion is successful in my book and this definitely pulls it off. In fact, the face is so captivating I didn''t even notice the breast until I saw Kelly''s comment below.', '2007-03-28 09:16:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493478, 486631, 20608, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot dude glad it hit a 6</td>', 'Sweet shot dude glad it hit a 6', '2007-03-28 09:17:16.000000', NULL, 0),
