(3494092, 486505, 64994, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, I like the hint of clouds in the sky and the color of sky as well. Maybe just distortion from wide angle lens but it looks tilted to the right. Just my opinian but I think if it were cropped a little tighter on the bottom and give it more room at the top it would help a bit. Good shot!</td>', 'Nice lighting, I like the hint of clouds in the sky and the color of sky as well. Maybe just distortion from wide angle lens but it looks tilted to the right. Just my opinian but I think if it were cropped a little tighter on the bottom and give it more room at the top it would help a bit. Good shot!', '2007-03-28 13:34:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3494140, 486614, 64994, '<td valign="top">Yes, I have to agree it makes me think, I wonder where he is...very simple yet emotional. Yes I read the Photographers comments, this was my first impression when I looked at it before I read the comment. Maybe cropped a little less on the right opening it up a bit would help IMO. Small consideration though I think.</td>', 'Yes, I have to agree it makes me think, I wonder where he is...very simple yet emotional. Yes I read the Photographers comments, this was my first impression when I looked at it before I read the comment. Maybe cropped a little less on the right opening it up a bit would help IMO. Small consideration though I think.', '2007-03-28 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3494165, 485606, 64994, '<td valign="top">Very cool portrait, great light, great pose, great shot!!!</td>', 'Very cool portrait, great light, great pose, great shot!!!', '2007-03-28 13:59:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3494175, 486456, 42013, '<td valign="top">Glad you finished high. I really liked the picture and it deserves top 10 for sure.</td>', 'Glad you finished high. I really liked the picture and it deserves top 10 for sure.', '2007-03-28 14:08:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3494211, 486505, 66384, '<td valign="top">I would have guessed Frankenmouth, but I see it''s Saginaw. Marvelous building. This is amazing for straight from the camera. The sky is a beautiful color, and I like all the points of light: inside, floods on the exterior, overheads in the entrances, and the flag. They all have a different quality. And the voters seemed to appreciate it too - not rave reviews, but a very respectable score. Well done.</td>', 'I would have guessed Frankenmouth, but I see it''s Saginaw. Marvelous building. This is amazing for straight from the camera. The sky is a beautiful color, and I like all the points of light: inside, floods on the exterior, overheads in the entrances, and the flag. They all have a different quality. And the voters seemed to appreciate it too - not rave reviews, but a very respectable score. Well done.', '2007-03-28 14:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3494231, 486629, 64994, '<td valign="top">The eyes are the first thing that grab me with this one. I would like to see the kitty''s front paws more in the light and I''m not sure about the border, but that''s just my opinian, cool shot!</td>', 'The eyes are the first thing that grab me with this one. I would like to see the kitty''s front paws more in the light and I''m not sure about the border, but that''s just my opinian, cool shot!', '2007-03-28 14:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3494236, 486614, 66384, '<td valign="top">So you haven''t worn this shirt lately and the poor thing is languishing on the hanger with its heart still yearning for you. I like the shirt, the lighting, the focus. I even like the door handle it''s hanging on. Not much WOW factor here though. Still, because of the good technicals: lighting, focus, sharpness, and the obvious use of multiple light sources, I gave it a 6.</td>', 'So you haven''t worn this shirt lately and the poor thing is languishing on the hanger with its heart still yearning for you. I like the shirt, the lighting, the focus. I even like the door handle it''s hanging on. Not much WOW factor here though. Still, because of the good technicals: lighting, focus, sharpness, and the obvious use of multiple light sources, I gave it a 6.', '2007-03-28 14:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3494251, 486413, 38127, '<td valign="top">Hey Stranger ;)  AWESOME That you entered another .. not a bad score either ;) ... only going up from here.  :) :)</td>', 'Hey Stranger ;)  AWESOME That you entered another .. not a bad score either ;) ... only going up from here.  :) :)', '2007-03-28 14:38:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3494255, 486629, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, but I scored it a little low, because I really didn''t see obvious use of multiple light sources. It looks to me like the light is all coming in through a window. I love the colors and the contrast, and you captured the cat nicely. I like the crop too. Fortunately, the most of the voters didn''t agree with me, and you finished very well. Congratulations.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, but I scored it a little low, because I really didn''t see obvious use of multiple light sources. It looks to me like the light is all coming in through a window. I love the colors and the contrast, and you captured the cat nicely. I like the crop too. Fortunately, the most of the voters didn''t agree with me, and you finished very well. Congratulations.', '2007-03-28 14:39:40.000000', NULL, 0),
