(3494437, 486529, 51750, '<td valign="top">To explain further, I threw the 3 penicls in the air at the same time and there was a single set of 20 flashes. My hands were never in the frame, and the editing was just levels and shadows/highlighs, nothing interesting really. <br/>I accidentily put it in the nude gallery. And im trying to get it changed.</td>', 'To explain further, I threw the 3 penicls in the air at the same time and there was a single set of 20 flashes. My hands were never in the frame, and the editing was just levels and shadows/highlighs, nothing interesting really. I accidentily put it in the nude gallery. And im trying to get it changed.', '2007-03-28 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
