(3495439, 485153, 60862, '<td valign="top">Okay, I didn''t vote in this challenge, but here ya go.<br/>10 for originality. 10 for guts. 10 for creep factor.  6 for focus (you knew that was coming, right?).  I find it interesting that the most negative reactions came from middle-aged folks.  Hmm...perhaps they''re showing themselves more than discussing your body?<br/> <br/>Now, that said, I have to admit your breast is distracting.  It drags my attention away from the other, more important elements.</td>', 'Okay, I didn''t vote in this challenge, but here ya go.10 for originality. 10 for guts. 10 for creep factor.  6 for focus (you knew that was coming, right?).  I find it interesting that the most negative reactions came from middle-aged folks.  Hmm...perhaps they''re showing themselves more than discussing your body? Now, that said, I have to admit your breast is distracting.  It drags my attention away from the other, more important elements.', '2007-03-28 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
