(3495916, 486222, 46598, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by metatate:</b></div><hr/><i> Adding this to my faves - I like this idea.  It''s odd that you have had 2 scores of 6.400 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Man you''re telling me!! I''m starting to think that there''s a conspiracy going on!! Not only do I have two scores of EXACTLY 6.4 BUT it''s also the two only photos where I used my assistant as a model. Spooky!!<br/> <br/>As for the photo, well I still prefer the one with no highlight on the ear. In the end I chickened out from taking a stand and added the ear highlight for fear of a DMNC disqualification.</td>', 'Originally posted by metatate: Adding this to my faves - I like this idea.  It''s odd that you have had 2 scores of 6.400   Man you''re telling me!! I''m starting to think that there''s a conspiracy going on!! Not only do I have two scores of EXACTLY 6.4 BUT it''s also the two only photos where I used my assistant as a model. Spooky!! As for the photo, well I still prefer the one with no highlight on the ear. In the end I chickened out from taking a stand and added the ear highlight for fear of a DMNC disqualification.', '2007-03-29 01:36:13.000000', NULL, 0),
