(3496364, 486529, 75504, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture !<br/>It is a very good use of the stroboscopic flash !<br/>I would never think about this !<br/>There was however at least 26 flashes and not 20, as the blue pencil tells us ;)<br/> <br/>I suppose that this comes from your shutter at 1/4th it gives 25 flashes at 100 hertz that''s why.<br/> <br/>Congratulations !<br/> <br/></td>', 'Very nice picture !It is a very good use of the stroboscopic flash !I would never think about this !There was however at least 26 flashes and not 20, as the blue pencil tells us ;) I suppose that this comes from your shutter at 1/4th it gives 25 flashes at 100 hertz that''s why. Congratulations ! ', '2007-03-29 09:01:42.000000', NULL, 0),
