(3543505, 485758, 75651, '<td valign="top">I did like this shot- but when I got it onto the computer I realized how out-of-focus she really was.  The problem I had with this is that it was a timed exposure to really pop out the back wall and her with as little light as possible. BUT, no person can truely stand absolutely still for 10sec unless your a trained manican(however you spell it).<br/> <br/>But I like the feel and I going try to magnify that throughout my entries.<br/> <br/>Your comments truely are helpful.  You are helping me to redifine my skills and to help me catch this that aren''t so obvious.<br/> <br/>Again thank you and good-luck to everyone else.</td>', 'I did like this shot- but when I got it onto the computer I realized how out-of-focus she really was.  The problem I had with this is that it was a timed exposure to really pop out the back wall and her with as little light as possible. BUT, no person can truely stand absolutely still for 10sec unless your a trained manican(however you spell it). But I like the feel and I going try to magnify that throughout my entries. Your comments truely are helpful.  You are helping me to redifine my skills and to help me catch this that aren''t so obvious. Again thank you and good-luck to everyone else.', '2007-04-12 17:19:09.000000', NULL, 0),
