(3569276, 484977, 56378, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BeckyT:</b></div><hr/><i> Great idea but it needs to be larger. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for your comments.. It was my first time entering and I was nervous.. you are all right about how small it is, but it wouldn''t let me make it any bigger or I just don''t know how to manipulate the "system".. <br/> <br/>Thanks for taking the time to comment!</td>', 'Originally posted by BeckyT: Great idea but it needs to be larger.   Thanks everyone for your comments.. It was my first time entering and I was nervous.. you are all right about how small it is, but it wouldn''t let me make it any bigger or I just don''t know how to manipulate the "system"..  Thanks for taking the time to comment!', '2007-04-21 19:53:55.000000', NULL, 0),
