(4337872, 486456, 22301, '<td valign="top">I really liked this in the challenge, such and interesting use of lights and shutterspeed. An easy fix for night shots in the city if your not using raw is to set the white balance to the one that looks like a lightbulb. Tungsten I think. It will make the colors more natural. :)</td>', 'I really liked this in the challenge, such and interesting use of lights and shutterspeed. An easy fix for night shots in the city if your not using raw is to set the white balance to the one that looks like a lightbulb. Tungsten I think. It will make the colors more natural. :)', '2007-12-27 04:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
